Description: GRBL-K firmware -- compiled .hex + GPLv3 source for the Konin CNC Arduino
 Precompiled AVR firmware image (grbl-k.hex) for the Arduino/CNC Shield
 controller, plus its full GPLv3 source (grbl-k is a fork of grbl with
 signed homing-distance reporting and control-button debounce). This
 package only stores the artifact -- it never flashes automatically.
 Flashing is a deliberate, operator-triggered action via
 install/lib/grbl-k-flash.sh (konin-deployment).
 Part of the Konin CNC system (konin-deployment).
